When [[Dante]] was elected mayor, [[Seraphine]] created a '''Resistance Movement''' in the [[Dark Auction]] house. This led to the election of the [[Resistance Leader]] ({{RN|pig|rank=no|Technoblade}}) and his generals. The revolt happened on April 16, 2021 at 6:30PM UTC.
