== Dante's message in the Hub ==
After the popular Hypixel YouTuber Technoblade went [https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=hv5tNAG1r_c live] about the [[Resistance Movement]], a [https://twitter.com/HypixelNetwork/status/1379932943062167552 tweet] from Hypixel's official Twitter, revealed a message from Dante. This message replaced the map in the [[Hub]].
{{Coll S B|id=dante_message|name=Click here to see Dante's Message}}
{{Coll S|id=dante_message|[[File:Dante MSG.jpg|512px]]}}

== Resistance Generals ==
The other six elected were the runner-ups in the election. They served as Technoblade's [[Resistance General|generals]] during the fight against Dante. Since 2nfg was banned at the time of the Uprising, he did not become a Minister, unlike the other five. However, his perk of reducing the player's Intelligence by 1 is still provided.

== Information ==
On 4/12/2021, popular Minecraft youtuber {{RN|pig|Technoblade}} was elected the leader of the resistance. Alongside him, the next six players with the most votes, were elected generals ({{RN|yt|rank=no|56ms}}, {{RN|a|rank=no|TimeDeo}}, {{RN|yt|rank=no|thirtyvirus}}, {{RN|MVP+|2nfg|rank=no}}, {{RN|yt|rank=no|FurryEBoy}}, {{RN|yt|rank=no|Refraction}}), who led the Resistance against [[Dante]].
* Special armor, called [[Armor of the Rising Sun]] was released, as well as a new weapon, [[Staff of the Rising Sun]], which was the only weapon that could deal damage to Dante. In order to obtain this armor from Seraphine, the player must've had at least 8 hours of playtime. Voting was '''not''' a requirement.

