See [[Dante#Boss Fight|Dante Uprising Fight]].

== The Uprising ==
[[File:Banner of the Rising Sun.png|thumb|right|x200px|Banner of the Uprising (Rising Sun)]]
The Uprising is the second half of the Resistance Movement, which involves the [[Armor of the Rising Sun]] and [[Staff of the Rising Sun]] distribution, the [[Dante#Boss Fight|Dante Uprising Fight]] and the Post-Uprising period. Mayor [[Technoblade]] and [[Resistance General]]s' perks were applied during the Post-Uprising period.

